        "# cFish.io WordPress Site Specifications\r",
        "\r",
        "## Project Overview\r",
        "cFish.io is a WordPress-based website that needs to be developed with modern web development practices, version control, and proper documentation.\r",
        "\r",
        "## Core Features\r",
        "\r",
        "### Essential Features\r",
        "- Responsive WordPress theme optimized for mobile and desktop\r",
        "- Blog/content management system\r",
        "- Contact form functionality\r",
        "- SEO optimization\r",
        "- Social media integration\r",
        "- Performance optimization\r",
        "- Security hardening\r",
        "\r",
        "### Important Features\r",
        "- E-commerce capabilities (if applicable)\r",
        "- User registration and profiles\r",
        "- Newsletter subscription\r",
        "- Media gallery\r",
        "- Search functionality\r",
        "- Custom post types for specialized content\r",
        "- Multilingual support (if needed)\r",
        "\r",
        "### Optimal Features\r",
        "- Analytics integration\r",
        "- Caching system\r",
        "- CDN integration\r",
        "- Automated backups\r",
        "- Custom admin dashboard\r",
        "- Advanced SEO features\r",
        "- Schema markup\r",
        "\r",
        "### Optional Features\r",
        "- Membership area\r",
        "- Forum/community features\r",
        "- Event calendar\r",
        "- Custom API integrations\r",
        "- Progressive Web App capabilities\r",
        "- Advanced search with filters\r",
        "- A/B testing capabilities\r",
        "\r",
        "## Technical Requirements\r",
        "\r",
        "### WordPress Core\r",
        "- Latest stable WordPress version\r",
        "- Regular updates and maintenance\r",
        "- Proper error logging and monitoring\r",
        "\r",
        "### Theme Development\r",
        "- Custom theme or properly customized premium theme\r",
        "- Mobile-first responsive design\r",
        "- Accessibility compliance (WCAG 2.1)\r",
        "- Cross-browser compatibility\r",
        "- Optimized page load speed\r",
        "\r",
        "### Plugin Strategy\r",
        "- Minimize plugin usage to essential functionality\r",
        "- Regular plugin updates\r",
        "- Security audits for third-party plugins\r",
        "- Custom plugin development for unique features\r",
        "\r",
        "### Security Measures\r",
        "- SSL implementation\r",
        "- Regular security scans\r",
        "- User role management\r",
        "- Login protection\r",
        "- File integrity monitoring\r",
        "- Database encryption for sensitive data\r",
        "\r",
        "### Performance Goals\r",
        "- Page load time under 2 seconds\r",
        "- Google PageSpeed score above 90\r",
        "- Optimized image delivery\r",
        "- Minified CSS/JS\r",
        "- Database query optimization\r",
        "\r",
        "## Development Milestones\r",
        "\r",
        "### Phase 1: Foundation\r",
        "- Set up development environment\r",
        "- Create documentation structure\r",
        "- Establish Git workflow\r",
        "- Configure basic WordPress installation\r",
        "- Implement basic theme structure\r",
        "\r",
        "### Phase 2: Core Functionality\r",
        "- Develop/customize theme\r",
        "- Implement essential plugins\r",
        "- Create content structure\r",
        "- Set up SEO foundations\r",
        "- Configure security measures\r",
        "\r",
        "### Phase 3: Advanced Features\r",
        "- Implement e-commerce (if applicable)\r",
        "- Develop custom post types\r",
        "- Create user management system\r",
        "- Set up analytics\r",
        "- Optimize performance\r",
        "\r",
        "### Phase 4: Refinement\r",
        "- User testing and feedback\r",
        "- Performance optimization\r",
        "- Security hardening\r",
        "- Content polishing\r",
        "- Final quality assurance\r",
        "\r",
        "### Phase 5: Launch and Maintenance\r",
        "- Production deployment\r",
        "- Monitoring setup\r",
        "- Backup system implementation\r",
        "- Update schedule establishment\r",
        "- Documentation finalization\r",
        "\r",
        "## Maintenance Plan\r",
        "- Weekly plugin updates\r",
        "- Monthly theme updates\r",
        "- Quarterly security audits\r",
        "- Bi-annual performance reviews\r",
        "- Regular content updates\r",
        "- Daily automated backups\r",
        "\r",
        "## Success Metrics\r",
        "- Website uptime (target: 99.9%)\r",
        "- Page load speed (target: < 2 seconds)\r",
        "- Mobile usability score (target: > 90%)\r",
        "- Conversion rates (specific to site goals)\r",
        "- SEO rankings for target keywords\r",
        "- User engagement metrics\r",
        "\r",
        "## Shortlinks Service\r",
        "The cFish.io ecosystem includes a dedicated shortlink service hosted at u.cfish.io that provides quick access to key documentation and information.\r",
        "\r",
        "### Shortlink Management\r",
        "- Shortlinks are maintained in markdown files and deployed to the live site\r",
        "- Each shortlink has standardized metadata including URL, last updated date, purpose, and target audience\r",
        "- AI-optimized JSON versions of each shortlink are maintained in the `/shortlinks/json/` directory\r",
        "- Follow standard WordPress development workflow for shortlink content changes\r",
        "\r",
        "### Available Shortlinks\r",
        "- [cFish](https://u.cfish.io/cfish) - Documentation for cFish.io operational procedures\r",
        "- [cFish IT](https://u.cfish.io/cfish-it) - Technical support and troubleshooting procedures\r",
        "- [tY](https://u.cfish.io/ty) - Personal and professional profile for tY FischEYe\r",
        "\r",
        "## Emergency Protocols\r",
        "The following emergency protocols are established for system issues:\r",
        "\r",
        "### Platform Integration Emergency Protocol\r",
        "- System issues are categorized by priority level (RED, AMBER, GREEN)\r",
        "- RED issues require immediate Tech Lead alert and system-wide health check\r",
        "- AMBER issues require 30-minute DMT Team alert and data integrity checks\r",
        "- GREEN issues require 2-hour Support Team alert and platform permission verification\r",
        "- All issues are documented in Notion and monitored until resolution\r",
        "- Unresolved issues are escalated to the next level\r",
        "\r",
        "### Data Synchronization Troubleshooting\r",
        "- Data mismatch issues trigger an alert to the DMT Team\r",
        "- Data integrity checks are run to identify and document issues\r",
        "- Platform status and integration points are verified\r",
        "- System-wide health checks are performed when necessary\r",
        "\r",
        "### Communication System Verification\r",
        "- Communication issues are categorized by system type (Live Chat, AI Assistant, Video Conf)\r",
        "- Direct testing is performed based on system type\r",
        "- Unresolved issues are escalated to the Support Team\r",
        "- All systems are verified after implementing fixes"
      ]
    }
  ],
